# cards: Dragon Magic for whoever wears the ring (docs/plan-cards.md 7.3). Jian and Lucia (party2_strong), first
# temple battle. Lucia wears the Blazing Ring in her ring slot (0x020B4700 = 0xCB); the Tidal Ring is only in the
# bag. Round 1: Jian Fights; Lucia's Special list shows Healing Water and Inferno (shot rl_list); Down, A casts
# Inferno: her battle MP (record 1, 0x0228E8E4) drops by 10 and every enemy takes fire damage (shots rl_cast_*).
# Round 2: Jian's Special has nothing to list (no ring worn, Tidal Wave not listed from the bag): shot rl_jian.
# Run with --save.
include party2_strong
poke u8 0x0213B9FA 1
poke u8 0x0213B9FB 1
